From da251c9b30c26299deb421af5265821d96ea91d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 2 May 2026 03:01:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4663/5749] refactor(background-agent): normalize task ID field
 naming

Rename BackgroundTask and attempt ID fields to camelCase across background-agent consumers while moving BackgroundManager construction to a single config object.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
